          "term": "5 Purposes of Splinting",
          "kind": "enumeration",
          "definition": "",
          "answers": [
            "Reduce movement of the injured part",
            "Reduce pain from unnecessary movement",
            "Prevent further damage to bones and tissues",
            "Protect blood vessels and nerves",
            "Support the injured extremity during transport"
          ],
          "position": 2,
          "updatedAt": 1783971504483
        },
        {
